# Theses

One note per position you hold. Copy `../Thesis Template.md` into `<TICKER>.md` and fill it when you open a position. The stress-test and earnings-retest workflows read these, extract your load-bearing claims, check your pre-registered disconfirmers, and write dated test notes alongside them.

`_EXAMPLE-EXMPL.md` is a sample so you can see the structure and test the agent. Delete it whenever.
